OL,3,AUnion attacks NatWest plans to get
OL,4,Aworkers back to the office
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Unite union has hit out at a plan
OL,7,Fby NatWest to reduce the rights of
OL,8,F30,000 of its employees to work from
OL,9,Fhome.
OL,11,FNatWest says it is moving to a hybrid
OL,12,Fapproach where workers will be required
OL,13,Fto attend the office at least two days
OL,14,Fa week, from February.
OL,16,FThe bank says this is still very
OL,17,Fcompetitive with the rest of the
OL,18,Ffinance industry, and exceptions will
OL,19,Fbe made for colleagues who require
OL,20,Fadditional flexibility.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
