OL,3,AUnion attacks NatWest plans to get
OL,4,Aworkers back to the office
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Unite said NatWest's decision was
OL,7,F"out of touch with the realities facing
OL,8,Fits workforce", with many facing higher
OL,9,Ftravel and childcare costs.
